    "title": "Bryntum Scheduler - The Scheduling Component With All The Features",
    "meta": {
        "description": "Schedule teachers, dentist appointments, or space shuttle launches. The Scheduler component is extremely configurable and built from the ground up with pure JavaScript. Wrappers are available for React, Angular and Vue.",
        "og_title": "Bryntum Scheduler - The Scheduling Component With All The Features",
        "og_description": "Schedule teachers, dentist appointments, or space shuttle launches. The Scheduler component is extremely configurable and built from the ground up with pure JavaScript. Wrappers are available for React, Angular and Vue."
