                    "src": "heroes/scheduler.svg"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "block_agbryntum_partnership",
            "type": "partnership",
            "heading": "Your JavaScript toolkit just got bigger",
            "body_html": "<p>Following our 2025 <a href=\"https://blog.ag-grid.com/ag-grid-and-bryntum-join-forces-to-strengthen-developer-tooling-for-modern-web-applications/\">partnership with Bryntum</a>, the components you trust for data now sit alongside the best tools for scheduling and project planning.</p><p>You already trust AG Grid for your data, Bryntum Scheduler gives you that same level of polish for visualising events, resources, and timelines — built by the same kind of team, to the same standard.</p>",
            "body_text": "Following our 2025 partnership with Bryntum, the components you trust for data now sit alongside the best tools for scheduling and project planning. You already trust AG Grid for your data, Bryntum Scheduler gives you that same level of polish for visualising events, resources, and timelines — built by the same kind of team, to the same standard.",
            "logo_light_src": "/images/campaigns/bryntum-products/shared/ag-grid-x-bryntum-light.svg",
            "logo_dark_src": "/images/campaigns/bryntum-products/shared/ag-grid-x-bryntum-dark.svg",
            "logo_alt": "AG Grid x Bryntum partnership"
        },
        {
            "id": "block_agbryntum_intro_video_scheduler",
            "type": "intro-video",
            "video_src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/lyae71QT0u8?feature=oembed",
            "title": "Bryntum Scheduler Intro"
        },
        {
            "id": "block_37b7ed910ff1f314c2115ab92055bf8c",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "reverse", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Feature-Rich",
            "body_html": "<p>Based on our <a href=\"/products/grid\">Grid component</a>, Bryntum Scheduler inherits many of its capabilities, making for an interactive Scheduler that supports:</p> <ul> <li>Drag-and-drop event resizing</li> <li>A convenient event editor and keyboard navigation</li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/export/\">PDF, PNG,</a> <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/exporttoexcel/\">Excel</a>, <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/exporttoics/\">ICS</a> and <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/print/\">print</a> formats for exporting data</li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/responsive/\">Responsive rendering</a></li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/dragfromgrid/\">Drag-and-drop event assignment</a></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Based on our Grid component , Bryntum Scheduler inherits many of its capabilities, making for an interactive Scheduler that supports: Drag-and-drop event resizing A convenient event editor and keyboard navigation PDF, PNG, Excel , ICS and print formats for exporting data Responsive rendering Drag-and-drop event assignment",
