        {
            "id": "block_35b80aec3b5a6c0ba5ef9594bd1ce23f",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["video-file", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Simplified Planning",
            "body_html": "<p>Bryntum Scheduler includes event and capacity summaries to support decision making. Schedule and plan with confidence knowing you can:</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/tree-summary-custom/\">Prevent task overallocation</a></li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/summary/\">See the totals</a> for events and other categories</li> <li>View <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/groupsummary/\">group summaries</a></li> <li>Display <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/tree-summary/\">group capacity limits</a></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Bryntum Scheduler includes event and capacity summaries to support decision making. Schedule and plan with confidence knowing you can: Prevent task overallocation See the totals for events and other categories View group summaries Display group capacity limits",
            "links": [
                {
                    "text": "Prevent task overallocation",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/tree-summary-custom/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "See the totals",
                    "href": "/products/scheduler/examples/summary/"
                },
