            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "reverse", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Build Advanced Solutions",
            "body_html": "<p>Empower users with advanced scheduling capabilities, so that they can:</p> <ul> <li>Visualize <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/dependencies/\">task dependencies</a></li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/partners/\">Sync events</a></li> <li>Display <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/groupsummary/\">group summaries</a></li> <li><a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/merge-cells/\">Merge events</a></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Empower users with advanced scheduling capabilities, so that they can: Visualize task dependencies Sync events Display group summaries Merge events",
