        {
            "id": "block_760c4c7cdc72f4963f0b44a291de9598",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "50+ More Widgets",
            "body_html": "<p class=\"p1\">Choose from a <a href=\"/products/scheduler/examples/kitchen-sink/\">wide range of UI elements</a> that easily make your app polished and professional:</p> <ul class=\"ul1\"> <li class=\"li1\">Add <strong>chat boxes, menus, toggles, sliders, and more</strong> to your Bryntum Scheduler app.</li> <li class=\"li1\">Meet user needs with fewer clicks and less searching.</li> <li class=\"li1\">Implement widgets easily with our clear documentation.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Choose from a wide range of UI elements that easily make your app polished and professional: Add chat boxes, menus, toggles, sliders, and more to your Bryntum Scheduler app. Meet user needs with fewer clicks and less searching. Implement widgets easily with our clear documentation.",
